  "prefLabel": "Plc 1404.07 Challenging a Denial of Initial Licensure; Challenging License Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1404.07 Challenging a Denial of Initial Licensure; Challenging License Conditions. An applicant who wishes to challenge the denial of an application for initial licensure or who wishes to challenge conditions included in the license shall do so as provided in Plc 304.10.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442 (formerly Plc 1404.09), eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
